        {
          "figmaNodeId": "90:31",
          "name": "Pricing FAQ",
          "widthPx": 175,
          "records": [
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "90:31",
              "name": null,
              "cells": [
                "Pricing FAQ"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "figmaNodeId": "90:32",
          "name": "grid",
          "widthPx": 1392,
          "records": [
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "90:36",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "Monthly or annual billing?",
                "Both. Annual is billed once up front and saves up to ~35% versus paying monthly. Switch anytime from the console."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "90:39",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "What happens if I exceed a plan limit?",
                "On paid plans you’re not cut off. Add extra sites, seats, and datasets at the rates in the usage table — they’re added to your subscription and itemized on your invoice — and AI credits past your included band are billed per 1,000 at your plan’s rate, unless you set a stop or a monthly ceiling in Billing. Free-plan limits are hard caps: when Free’s AI credits are used, generation stops until next month."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "2146:625",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "What does Aglyn AI cost?",
                "Every paid plan includes a monthly band of AI credits, and every Aglyn AI action draws on it, generation included. For more, add AI credits to any paid plan, per workspace: blocks of 5,000 credits for $10 a month, up to 30 blocks, on top of the plan’s own; Custom by agreement. Credits past the band are billed per 1,000 at the rate in the usage table. If you’d rather it stopped, turn on Stop AI assist at the included band in Billing, or set a monthly dollar ceiling on overage. Free includes 300 credits a month and stops there — nothing is billed."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "90:42",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "How do transaction fees work?",
                "Payments run on Stripe. Aglyn adds a transaction fee on top of Stripe’s processing, depending on plan and what you sell: physical goods on the lower rate, digital products and services (bookings included) on the higher one. Starter is 5% digital and 2% physical, Pro 3% and 0.5%, and Custom 0%."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "90:45",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "Can I self-host instead of subscribing?",
                "Yes. Aglyn is Apache-2.0 — run it yourself with Docker and your own Firebase project (see the self-hosting guide), or use the hosted platform and skip the ops."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "90:48",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "Can I change or cancel anytime?",
                "Upgrade, downgrade, or cancel whenever you like from the billing page. Upgrades and downgrades are prorated as a charge or credit on your next invoice, and a canceled plan stays active until the end of the billing period you’ve already paid for."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "604:1272",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "Have a promo code?",
                "Apply it at checkout — promotion codes work on any paid plan and show up itemized on your invoice."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "604:1275",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "Do you offer SSO or an SLA?",
                "SAML / OIDC single sign-on is available on the Custom plan today — you set it up yourself in the console after proving your domain. Custom also includes dedicated support with a named manager and a 24–48 hour first response. We do not offer a contractual uptime SLA."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "2297:56084",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "How much does it cost to build a website on Aglyn?",
                "Nothing to build and publish on the free plan: one site, up to five pages, forms, media and AI credits. Your own domain, the store, bookings and the CRM come with Starter; the pricing page lists every plan."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "2297:56087",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "Is the free plan a trial?",
                "No. It does not expire or downgrade. It is capped rather than billed: one site, five pages, 250 MB of storage and 2 GB of bandwidth a month."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "2345:9777",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "How does Aglyn compare to alternatives?",
                "Our comparison pages set Aglyn beside Webflow, Wix, Squarespace, WordPress, Shopify and Duda, dated, and say where each of them is the better answer."
              ]
            },
            {
              "figmaNodeId": "2345:9780",
              "name": "qa",
              "cells": [
                "What is Aglyn?",
                "Aglyn is a website builder with the store, forms, CRM, email, analytics and Aglyn AI built in. It is open source and free to start."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "notes": null
